'One complete static janitorial hand-tool carry-tray arrangement, one new scene zero new independent models. The whole qualified waisted trigger bottle stands rear-left, the whole qualified overhead-arch scrub brush rests rear-right, and the whole qualified revised straight-channel hand squeegee lies separately across the front. All three entire source props retain every original geometry payload, normal, PBR dictionary, face assignment and internal hierarchy under unit-scale whole translations only. No crop, extraction, recolour, scaling or repeated model count. A new continuous low-floor tray with three high rims, a lower front rim and an integral full-span raised carrying arch provides scene-only context; no divided deep utensil wells or new standalone caddy asset. Whole props are separated, fully inside the tray and below or clear of the arch. No contents, liquid, use, cleaning, sanitation, chemical compatibility, carrying load, grip fit, movement, stability, manufacture or safety capability. Rigging animation and interaction not made.'
